Third-party components
----------------------

memnoth is built on open-source crates, each used under its own license. The
authoritative list is `Cargo.lock`; the license of every dependency can be
checked with:

    cargo deny check licenses

Principal dependencies and their licenses:

  * ratatui, crossterm ............................... MIT
  * clap, clap_complete .............................. MIT OR Apache-2.0
  * tokio, serde, serde_json, reqwest, hyper ......... MIT OR Apache-2.0
  * rusqlite ......................................... MIT
  * SQLite (bundled via rusqlite) .................... Public Domain
  * ignore, globset (ripgrep) ........................ MIT OR Unlicense
  * tree-sitter and grammars ......................... MIT
  * regex, walkdir, toml, chrono ..................... MIT OR Apache-2.0
  * anyhow, thiserror ................................ MIT OR Apache-2.0

